{"id":591,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Amoonguss generally doesn’t move much. It tends to stand still near Poké Balls that have been dropped on the ground."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon puffs poisonous spores at its foes. If the spores aren’t washed off quickly, they’ll grow into mushrooms wherever they land."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"It lures prey close by dancing and waving its arm caps, which resemble Poké Balls, in a swaying motion."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It moves the caps on both arms and does a dance to lure prey. It prefers damp places."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Effect Spore","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may inflict poison, sleep, or paralysis on the attacker."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":590,"name":"Foongus","condition":null,"children":[{"id":591,"name":"Amoonguss","condition":"Lv. 39","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,71],[1,74],[1,78],[1,310],[12,72],[16,235],[20,499],[24,230],[28,202],[32,275],[36,92],[42,476],[48,76],[54,147]],"machine":[34,331,203,412,263,492,202,416,447,580,506,63,437,345,676,182,240,156,184,402,214,188,76,707,164,241,851,92,474],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-96","name":"Amoonguss","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"96","artist":"OKUBO","img":"zsv10pt5/96"},{"id":"zsv10pt5-11","name":"Amoonguss","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"11","artist":"Kurata So","img":"zsv10pt5/11"},{"id":"sv9-11","name":"Amoonguss ex","set":"Journey Together","date